# module_fallback — persistent per-module canary/fallback system
# Reads misc sector 131 for module health state.
# Stages the state-selected module build (reconstructed or stock) onto
# the socko partition BEFORE the stock vendor preloads insmod it.
#
# Stock load contract: the vendor rcs (wcn.rc / init.md.rc / camera.rc)
# insmod the socko modules at `on post-fs` — measured t=4.7 s on device —
# and the HALs then find the drivers already up (their load path
# tolerates the already-loaded case). System rcs are parsed before
# vendor rcs, so a synchronous exec at `on post-fs` stages the canary's
# chosen build ahead of every vendor insmod. exec_background raced and
# lost that race on every previous boot.
on post-fs
    exec - root root -- /system/bin/module_fallback.sh boot

on property:sys.boot_completed=1
    exec_background - root root -- /system/bin/module_fallback.sh verify
